{"id":"5a17c5ecd1b117ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-V-equals-L.md","title":"Constructibility Hypothesis","display":"thm-V-equals-L — Constructibility Hypothesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-V-equals-L","aliases":["58-thm-V-equals-L","Constructibility Hypothesis","V = L","Gödel's Hypothesis"],"display":"thm-V-equals-L — Constructibility Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-thm-L-is-transitive]]","[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH]]","[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-V-equals-L"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-V-equals-L</span><span>Constructibility Hypothesis</span><span>V = L</span><span>Gödel's Hypothesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-V-equals-L — Constructibility Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"475f48ba187a2469\" href=\"?note=475f48ba187a2469\" title=\"58-thm-L-is-transitive\">58-thm-L-is-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" href=\"?note=bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" title=\"58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH\">58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2331ede3868d950e\" href=\"?note=2331ede3868d950e\" title=\"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md\">../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(x,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> is the set-valued constructible hierarchy from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> are the fixed set-coded theories, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> is the fixed generalized-continuum-hypothesis sentence</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(-)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(-)\\)</span> occurs only in the explicitly metatheoretic relative-consistency statement</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathsf T_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 为本文件相对一致性陈述所固定的元理论记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}\\)</span> 在该元理论中按上述句法一致性解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructibility\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n(V=L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructibility\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n(V=L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}V\\text{-}equals\\text{-}L}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{GCH}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}V\\text{-}equals\\text{-}L}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{GCH}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\models\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF})\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\{\\forall x\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\models\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF})\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\{\\forall x\\;\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S(x)\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consequences commonly associated with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=L\">\\(V=L\\)</span> include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg0^\\sharp\">\\(\\neg0^\\sharp\\)</span>; moreover <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> yields a Suslin tree, so the Suslin Hypothesis fails.</li>\n<li>The dependency on the downstream diamond-properties theorem was removed: it was unnecessary for the two assertions and created a dependency cycle.  The consistency implication is marked as metatheoretic instead of being asserted as an object theorem of the very theory whose consistency is under discussion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span>-minimal inner model containing all ordinals.</li>\n<li>Under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span>, the reals admit a definable well-order.</li>\n<li>Gödel (1938): introduced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> and proved consistency of AC + GCH.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span> resolves many independence questions (but not all).</li>\n<li>&quot;Minimal&quot; universe: contrasted with forcing models.</li>\n<li>Definable well-order: very strong consequence.</li>\n<li>Critics: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span> is &quot;artificially small,&quot; excludes &quot;generic&quot; sets.</li>\n<li>Alternative: forcing axioms like MA, PFA for &quot;maximality&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-L-is-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"475f48ba187a2469","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-L-is-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH","status":"resolved","id":"bdf91bc7ddbdd903","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2331ede3868d950e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,\\alpha\\in V$ and $L_\\alpha$ is the set-valued constructible hierarchy from [[58-df-constructible-universe]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConstructibleSet}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"x,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{